{"id": "section-body-18069", "title": "Calcifying odontogenic tumor Clinical Presentation", "chapterId": "chapter-sixteen", "tocLevel": 4, "tocPath": ["APPROACH TO PATIENTS WITH EMERGENCY CONDITIONS", "ORAL AND MAXILLOFACIAL CONDITIONS", "Tumours and Tumour-Like Conditions of Oral Cavity and Facial Region", "Calcifying odontogenic tumor"], "blocks": [{"id": "body-18069", "type": "heading", "style": "Heading4", "text": "Calcifying odontogenic tumor Clinical Presentation", "runs": [{"text": "Calcifying"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "odontogenic"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "tumor Clinical Presentation"}], "level": 4, "list": {"level": 3, "numberingId": "1109"}}, {"id": "body-18070", "type": "paragraph", "style": "ListParagraph", "text": "Most often found in the mandibular molar/premolar region, but 33% of cases are found in the maxilla", "runs": [{"text": "Most"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "often"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "found"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "in"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "the"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "mandibular"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "molar/premolar"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "region,"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "but"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "33%"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "of"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "cases"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "are"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "found"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "in"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "the"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "maxilla"}], "list": {"level": 4, "numberingId": "1109"}}, {"id": "body-18071", "type": "paragraph", "style": "ListParagraph", "text": "It is associated with an unerupted or impacted tooth in 50% of cases", "runs": [{"text": "It"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "is"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "associated"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "with"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "an"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "unerupted"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "or"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "impacted"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "tooth"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "in"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "50%"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "of"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "cases"}], "list": {"level": 4, "numberingId": "1109"}}, {"id": "body-18073", "type": "heading", "style": "Heading4", "text": "Investigations", "runs": [{"text": "Investigations"}], "level": 4}, {"id": "body-18074", "type": "paragraph", "style": "ListParagraph", "text": "Radiographically these lesions can be radiolucent, but more characteristically are mixed lucent and opaque masses, exhibiting a snow-driven appearance", "runs": [{"text": "Radiographically"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "these"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "lesions"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "can"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "be"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "radiolucent,"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "but"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "more"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "characteristically"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "are"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "mixed"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "lucent"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "and"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "opaque masses, exhibiting a snow-driven appearance"}], "list": {"level": 4, "numberingId": "1109"}}, {"id": "body-18075", "type": "heading", "style": "Heading4", "text": "Non-Pharmacological Management", "runs": [{"text": "Non-Pharmacological"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "Management"}], "level": 4}, {"id": "body-18076", "type": "paragraph", "style": "ListParagraph", "text": "Complete excision of the tumour with border of normal bone should be curative, but curettage or incomplete excision has high recurrence rates.", "runs": [{"text": "Complete excision of the tumour with border of normal bone should be curative, but curettage or incomplete"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "excision has high recurrence rates."}], "list": {"level": 4, "numberingId": "1109"}}], "source": {"file": "medical.docx", "chapter": "Oral and maxillofacial conditions", "start": "body-18069", "end": "body-18076"}}